3. [MAJOR] tests/memory_model_test.rs:289 — `no_cycle_collector_exists_anywhere_in_the_crate` forbids `Weak`/`WeakRef`/`Gc`/`gc::`/`weak_count` but permits `downgrade`/`upgrade`/`strong_count`/`ptr_eq`; a collector built via `Arc::downgrade` with inferred type contains none of the forbidden tokens, so collection can be added without failing the test.
